---
kind: lore
id: end.ren
title: Ren's endings
---

<beat id="lantern" on="termEnd" after="visited('ren.confession')" title="Ren — the lantern ending" priority="10" when="run.route == 'ren' && @devoted(run.aff.ren)">
  @narrator: The closing ceremony. The president's chair on the stage is empty.
  @ren{emotion="happy"}: I wrote to my father. I told him the island needs a council president more than the mainland needs another heir. He hasn't answered. I don't need him to.
  @ren{emotion="fond"}: Sign here. Once is enough, this time.
  ::use{component="cg" id="cgRenEnd"}
  ::use{component="ending" who="ren" kind="good" title="Ren — the lantern ending"}
</beat>

<beat id="ember" on="termEnd" after="visited('ren.confession')" title="Ren — the ember ending" priority="5" when="run.route == 'ren'">
  @narrator: The ferry horn goes twice. Ren is on the deck with his register under his arm.
  @ren{emotion="sad"}: I'll write. Officially. On letterhead. ...Name a star after me, if you find a spare one.
  ::use{component="ending" who="ren" kind="bittersweet" title="Ren — the ember ending"}
</beat>
